00:01:52.982 --> 00:01:56.070
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:56.903
- [Natasha] Yeah.

00:01:56.903 --> 00:01:57.736
- That's amazing.

00:01:57.736 --> 00:02:00.330
- So I just kind of danced
along to what I was singing.

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:01.290
- You just moved your..

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:02.940
- Yeah and what, what put it

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:05.558
