00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:21.120
- [Natasha] That's right. That's
right. I was in the chorus.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:22.590
I was in the deep chorus.

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:25.410
I, they don't create
