00:02:34.036 --> 00:02:35.790
- I'm a 50\50 actor at best.

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:37.997
- [Kelly] Oh my God! (laughs)

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:39.983
- Oh

00:02:39.983 --> 00:02:40.830
- I had a moment like that in high school.

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:42.720
I had one in high school and it was like

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:45.000
everyone was so loud and everyone was like

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.260
oh she can hit whistle notes.

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:47.820
So I was like, put a
